description: Never attribute git/GitHub work to AI agents
alwaysApply: true
---

# No agent GitHub contributors

- Never attribute commits or pull requests to Cursor, Composer, Auto, or any AI agent.
- Never add `Co-authored-by:` trailers for Cursor, bots, or agents in commit messages.
- Never invite or add agents/bots as GitHub collaborators or contributors.
- Commits and PRs must use only the human author's git identity.
- Do not change git `user.name` / `user.email` to an agent identity.
